<title>UK: Smiths says may buy parts of BOC's Ohmeda.</title>
<headline>Smiths says may buy parts of BOC's Ohmeda.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smiths Industries Plc said on Thursday it may be interested in buying parts of BOC Group Plc's Ohmeda subsidiary, which BOC said was for sale yesterday.</p>
</text>
